This past week, we received some fresh harvest coffee through one of our favorite programs, the Black Producer’s Program. It was created in collaboration with Phyllis Johnson & Miriam Monteiro de Aguiar, to answer Phyllis’s question: “Where are the Black Brazilian coffee farmers?” 

At Little Waves, we’re proud to work with farmers through this program. Through the program, we’ve worked with Neide Peixoto and her family (Sítio Santo Antônio) and the Aparecido family (Sítio Pico do Boné). 

