Last week’s #Omnivore screening was a success! Thanks to everyone that joined us and a special thanks to Matt Goulding, co-creator of Omnivore, for joining our Q&A and Robert Olinger, for conducting said Q&A. 

We loved hearing everyone’s questions and insights from Areli and Matt. It was so great to see the adventure of coffee making its way from Rwanda to Durham. Puts it all into perspective. 

